### GET /api/fields/find-by-point — manual test cases
#
# Run with the VS Code "REST Client" extension or the JetBrains HTTP Client (click ▶ next to a request).
# Expected results assume the default seed data only:
#     docker compose run --rm seed --reset
# Any other data (extra seed runs, fields created via POST) changes what these points return.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000


### 1. No fields — Lviv city centre (no seeded fields within 10 km)
# Expected: "fields": []
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fields/find-by-point?lon=24.0316&lat=49.8419


### 2. No fields — inside the hole (pond) of "Поле №1 - Соя", Чернігівська обл.
# The point lies within the field's outer boundary but inside its hole, so it is NOT in the field.
# Expected: "fields": []
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fields/find-by-point?lon=31.297692&lat=51.189915


### 3. Single field — "Поле №821 - Соя" (400.4 ha, Коваль К.Д.), Вінницька обл.
# No other field within 500 m.
# Expected: 1 field, distance_to_center_m ≈ 697.4
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fields/find-by-point?lon=28.460771&lat=50.021719


### 4. Two overlapping fields — Тернопільська обл.
# Expected (nearest centre first):
#   Поле №314 - Цукровий буряк   ≈ 120.0 m
#   Поле №310 - Пшениця озима    ≈ 266.1 m
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fields/find-by-point?lon=25.248320&lat=49.798351


### 5. Five overlapping fields — Чернігівська обл.
# Expected (nearest centre first):
#   Поле №26 - Пшениця озима     ≈ 109.3 m
#   Поле №2 - Горох              ≈ 121.5 m
#   Поле №399 - Соняшник         ≈ 134.6 m
#   Поле №74 - Кукурудза         ≈ 144.1 m
#   Поле №946 - Кукурудза        ≈ 220.2 m
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fields/find-by-point?lon=31.466513&lat=50.990566


### 6. Validation error — latitude out of range
# Expected: 422, "Input should be less than or equal to 90"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/fields/find-by-point?lon=30.5&lat=91
